<title>USA: USDA says El Salvador gets $10 mln under PL480.</title>
<headline>USDA says El Salvador gets $10 mln under PL480.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said El Salvador has been authorized to buy $6 million worth of soybean meal, $2.8 million worth of vegetable oil and $1.2 million worth of tallow under Public Law 480.</p>
<p>USDA said the contracting period is April 9 through Sept. 30 and the delivery period is April 9 through Dec. 31.</p>
</text>
